//! The seeds a well-stocked vault holds, as a list the person can add from in one tap. Each line is
//! (crop, group, why it is on the list, when to plant in words the calendar understands, days to harvest,
//! how many packets to aim for). Nothing is added to the vault until the person chooses it, and a crop
//! already in the vault is not added twice.

pub struct Suggested {
    pub crop: &'static str,
    pub group: &'static str,
    pub why: &'static str,
    pub plant_when: &'static str,
    pub days: f64,
    pub target: f64,
}

